@startuml
title FE-13 Staff/Manager Close and Member Soft-Hide Conversation
actor Member
actor Staff
actor Manager
participant ConsultationController
participant ConsultationApplicationService
database ConsultationConversationRepository
database ConsultationAuditEventRepository
Staff -> ConsultationController : close in-scope conversation
ConsultationController -> ConsultationApplicationService : verify Staff location scope
ConsultationApplicationService -> ConsultationConversationRepository : set CLOSED
ConsultationApplicationService -> ConsultationAuditEventRepository : record close
Manager -> ConsultationController : close/reopen authorized conversation
ConsultationController -> ConsultationApplicationService : verify Manager authority
ConsultationApplicationService -> ConsultationConversationRepository : update status
Member -> ConsultationController : confirm soft-hide closed conversation
ConsultationController -> ConsultationApplicationService : verify owner, CLOSED and version
ConsultationApplicationService -> ConsultationConversationRepository : set member-hidden flag
ConsultationApplicationService -> ConsultationAuditEventRepository : record member hide
note over Member,Manager
Soft-hide removes the chat from Member sidebar only.
Messages and store history remain retained.
end note
@enduml
